      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Standup Timer</title>\n  <style>\n    [hidden] {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    :root {\n      --bg-color: #14101e;\n      --card-bg: #261f3b;\n      --card-border: #4d3e72;\n      --accent: #f8c53a;\n      --accent-active: #d69e1b;\n      --text-main: #f5f0ff;\n      --text-muted: #9e93bc;\n      --danger: #e65c5c;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background-color: var(--bg-color);\n      /* Pixel grid background pattern */\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 2px, transparent 2px),\n        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 2px, transparent 2px);\n      background-size: 24px 24px;\n      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace, monospace;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 20px;\n      image-rendering: pixelated;\n    }\n\n    .app-card {\n      background: var(--card-bg);\n      border: 4px solid var(--card-border);\n      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #090710;\n      padding: 28px 24px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 440px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      text-align: center;\n      border-bottom: 4px dashed var(--card-border);\n      padding-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;\n    }\n\n    .roster-section {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .roster-title {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .roster-list {\n      list-style: none;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .speaker-item {\n      padding: 10px 14px;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n      border: 2px solid transparent;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;\n    }\n\n    .speaker-item.active {\n      background: #392e59;\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n    }\n\n    .speaker-item.completed {\n      color: #635b7e;\n      text-decoration: line-through;\n    }\n\n    .timer-display {\n      background: #110d1c;\n      border: 4px solid #000000;\n      padding: 20px 12px;\n      text-align: center;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n    }\n\n    .timer-time {\n      font-size: 3.5rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: 4px;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #000;\n      display: block;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n\n    .timer-time.warning {\n      color: var(--danger);\n    }\n\n    .finished-message {\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      text-align: center;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      padding: 16px 8px;\n      border: 3px dashed var(--accent);\n      background: #1c152e;\n    }\n\n    .controls {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .btn {\n      flex: 1;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #14101e;\n      border: 3px solid #000000;\n      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #000000;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n\n    .btn:hover:not(:disabled) {\n      background: #ffcf4d;\n      transform: translate(-1px, -1px);\n      box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px #000000;\n    }\n\n    .btn:focus-visible {\n      outline: 3px solid #ffffff;\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .btn:active:not(:disabled) {\n      transform: translate(3px, 3px);\n      box-shadow: 1px 1px 0px #000000;\n      background: var(--accent-active);\n    }\n\n    .btn:disabled {\n      background: #473e61;\n      color: #7b7294;\n      cursor: not-allowed;\n      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000;\n      transform: none;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"app-card\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Pixel Standup Timer App\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Standup Timer</h1>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"roster-section\" aria-label=\"Participants list\">\n      <span class=\"roster-title\">Team Roster (90s each)</span>\n      <ul class=\"roster-list\" id=\"speakerList\" role=\"list\"></ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"timer-container\" aria-label=\"Current speaker countdown\">\n      <div class=\"timer-display\" id=\"timerBox\">\n        <time id=\"timeRemaining\" class=\"timer-time\" aria-live=\"polite\">1:30</time>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"standupOverMessage\" class=\"finished-message\" hidden role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        Standup over\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"controls\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"nextBtn\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Move to next participant\">Next</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"resetBtn\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Restart standup from beginning\">Reset</button>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    const NAMES = ['Alex', 'Blake', 'Charlie', 'Dana'];\n    const TURN_SECONDS = 90;\n\n    let currentIndex = 0;\n    let secondsRemaining = TURN_SECONDS;\n    let timerInterval = null;\n\n    const speakerListEl = document.getElementById('speakerList');\n    const timeRemainingEl = document.getElementById('timeRemaining');\n    const timerBoxEl = document.getElementById('timerBox');\n    const standupOverEl = document.getElementById('standupOverMessage');\n    const nextBtn = document.getElementById('nextBtn');\n    const resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn');\n\n    function formatTime(seconds) {\n      const m = Math.floor(seconds / 60);\n      const s = seconds % 60;\n      return `${m}:${s < 10 ? '0' : ''}${s}`;\n    }\n\n    function renderRoster() {\n      speakerListEl.innerHTML = '';\n      NAMES.forEach((name, idx) => {\n        const li = document.createElement('li');\n        li.className = 'speaker-item';\n        if (idx === currentIndex && currentIndex < NAMES.length) {\n          li.classList.add('active');\n          li.setAttribute('aria-current', 'step');\n        } else if (idx < currentIndex) {\n          li.classList.add('completed');\n        }\n\n        const nameSpan = document.createElement('span');\n        nameSpan.textContent = `${idx + 1}. ${name}`;\n        li.appendChild(nameSpan);\n\n        const statusSpan = document.createElement('span');\n        if (idx === currentIndex && currentIndex < NAMES.length) {\n          statusSpan.textContent = '▶ ACTIVE';\n        } else if (idx < currentIndex) {\n          statusSpan.textContent = 'DONE';\n        }\n        li.appendChild(statusSpan);\n\n        speakerListEl.appendChild(li);\n      });\n    }\n\n    function updateTimerDisplay() {\n      timeRemainingEl.textContent = formatTime(secondsRemaining);\n      if (secondsRemaining <= 10) {\n        timeRemainingEl.classList.add('warning');\n      } else {\n        timeRemainingEl.classList.remove('warning');\n      }\n    }\n\n    function nextPerson() {\n      if (currentIndex < NAMES.length - 1) {\n        currentIndex++;\n        secondsRemaining = TURN_SECONDS;\n        renderRoster();\n        updateTimerDisplay();\n      } else {\n        endStandup();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function endStandup() {\n      clearInterval(timerInterval);\n      timerInterval = null;\n      currentIndex = NAMES.length;\n      renderRoster();\n      timerBoxEl.hidden = true;\n      standupOverEl.hidden = false;\n      nextBtn.disabled = true;\n    }\n\n    function startTimer() {\n      clearInterval(timerInterval);\n      timerInterval = setInterval(() => {\n        if (secondsRemaining > 0) {\n          secondsRemaining--;\n          updateTimerDisplay();\n        } else {\n          nextPerson();\n        }\n      }, 1000);\n    }\n\n    function init() {\n      clearInterval(timerInterval);\n      currentIndex = 0;\n      secondsRemaining = TURN_SECONDS;\n      timerBoxEl.hidden = false;\n      standupOverEl.hidden = true;\n      nextBtn.disabled = false;\n      renderRoster();\n      updateTimerDisplay();\n      startTimer();\n    }\n\n    nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      nextPerson();\n    });\n\n    resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      init();\n    });\n\n    init();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Single-page pixel-themed standup timer application containing structure, styling, and JavaScript logic."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Standup Timer\n\nA lightweight, offline, browser-based standup timer designed with an authentic 8-bit retro aesthetic.\n\n## Features\n\n- **4 Built-in Participants**: Tracks turns for Alex, Blake, Charlie, and Dana.\n- **90-Second Countdown**: Each person gets 90 seconds displayed in standard `m:ss` format.\n- **Highlighted Active Speaker**: The active participant is highlighted in high contrast with status indicators.\n- **Early Skipping**: The `Next` button allows moving to the next person before their time runs out.\n- **Completion State**: Automatically displays \"Standup over\" once the final speaker concludes their turn.\n- **Reset Control**: Reset anytime to restart the roster from the first participant.\n- **Zero External Dependencies**: Pure vanilla HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript with complete offline compliance.\n- **Accessibility**: Semantic HTML, screen-reader status regions, keyboard navigable controls, and high-contrast color scheme.\n\n## Getting Started\n\nOpen `index.html` directly in any modern desktop or mobile browser. No web server, bundler, or network access required.\n",
      "description": "Project documentation including features, usage instructions, and implementation details."
    }
  ]
}